2. Pro features — licensed, not sold
------------------------------------
The following are "Pro Features" and require a valid licence key:

  - the Markdown, HTML, JUnit XML and SARIF report writers (src/report.js, pro section)
  - `rowdiff --detect --explain`

A licence grants the holder a non-exclusive, non-transferable right to use the Pro Features
in perpetuity for their own organisation, on any number of machines, for the number of seats
purchased. A licence key may not be resold, published, or shared outside the purchasing
organisation.

Redistribution of the Pro Features as part of another product requires written permission.

